ction $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x,$ shown in the graph below:\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x]=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x]=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039465/assets/27ec65761e5119be666e69b67b2fa2fcb7b4f3665ddc41faddd6c136d5c955b1.png)\n\nUsing this to evaluate our integral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{10}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =10\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(a)]-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =10\\cdot (\\frac{\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306913 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306914 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306915 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306916 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306917 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1041 "selection" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1104 #edb/ref 17592186306917 13194139534741 true] [17592186306912 1110 #uuid "a640a830-81a9-5899-bfb9-78e7899ffc34" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306913 1034 "\\frac{5\\pi }{4}" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534741 true] [17592186306913 1111 #uuid "2ee1de72-e0de-5c4c-8deb-fb2d73ed96d8" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306914 1034 "5\\pi " 13194139534741 true] [17592186306914 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534741 true] [17592186306914 1111 #uuid "c28c9654-e208-562c-92a1-6392d740d540" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306915 1034 "10\\pi " 13194139534741 true] [17592186306915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534741 true] [17592186306915 1111 #uuid "4e086c7b-b15f-5e0e-b27e-3844fc26351e" 13194139534741 true] [17592186306916 1034 "2\\pi " 13194139534741 true] [1